## Data Models

### PlantInputData
Validates input data for plant care guidance generation.

**Fields:**

| Field | Type | Constraints | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|-------------|
| plant_name | string | 1-100 chars | Name of the plant |
| plant_type | string | 1-50 chars | Type (Vegetable, Flower, Herb, etc.) |
| climate | string | 1-50 chars | Climate zone |
| sunlight_hours | integer | 0-24 | Daily sunlight hours |
| soil_type | string | 1-50 chars | Soil type |
| watering_frequency | string | 1-50 chars | How often to water |
| experience_level | string | 1-50 chars | Beginner/Intermediate/Advanced |

**Common Values:**

- **plant_type**: Vegetable, Flower, Herb, Succulent, Tree, Shrub
- **climate**: Tropical, Temperate, Mediterranean, Arid, Continental
- **soil_type**: Loamy, Clay, Sandy, Silty, Chalky, Peaty
- **watering_frequency**: Daily, Every 2 days, Weekly, Bi-weekly, Monthly
- **experience_level**: Beginner, Intermediate, Advanced

