## Performance

### Expected Response Times
- Health Check: < 100ms
- Plant Guide (with API keys): 2-5 seconds
- Plant Guide (mock mode): < 1 second

### Optimization Tips
- Response times depend on Gemini API latency
- Consider caching common plant queries
- Implement request queuing for high traffic

